        <IRI>perfila_estandar</IRI>
        <Literal xml:lang="en">States that a standard is an application profile of another: it restricts or adapts it to a particular context or community (e.g. DCAT-AP with respect to DCAT).</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>

